      "description": "White field, explicit label, visible focus and adjacent error treatment.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-field\"><label for=\"ds-name\">Tu nombre</label><input id=\"ds-name\" autocomplete=\"name\" placeholder=\"¿Cómo te llamas?\" maxlength=\"100\" required aria-describedby=\"ds-name-error\"/><span class=\"ds-error\" id=\"ds-name-error\"></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-field{font-family:var(--font,'Figtree','Segoe UI',sans-serif);color:var(--ink,#2e2839)}.ds-field label{display:block;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--violet-deep,#39235e)}.ds-field input{display:block;width:calc(100% - 34px);padding:13px 16px;border:1px solid var(--rule,#dfd9e7);border-radius:12px;background:var(--white,#fff);color:inherit;font:400 1rem/1.5 var(--font,'Figtree','Segoe UI',sans-serif);caret-color:var(--violet,#6041a6);transition:border-color 180ms}.ds-field input::placeholder{color:var(--ink-2,#635e6c);opacity:1}.ds-field input:focus{border-color:var(--violet,#6041a6)}.ds-field input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--violet,#6041a6);outline-offset:5px}.ds-field input[aria-invalid=true]{border-color:var(--error,#a32e38)}.ds-error{display:block;color:var(--error,#a32e38);font-size:.85rem}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-field input{transition:none}}"
