    {
      "name": "Section navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Plain-language links with violet current-location feedback.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Navegación principal\"><a href=\"#quien\">Quién soy</a><a href=\"#servicios\" aria-current=\"location\">Servicios</a><a href=\"#contacto\">Contacto</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px;align-items:center;font-family:var(--font,'Figtree','Segoe UI',sans-serif);color:var(--ink,#2e2839)}.ds-nav a{position:relative;padding-block:12px;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;color:inherit;transition:color 160ms}.ds-nav a:hover,.ds-nav a[aria-current=location]{color:var(--violet,#6041a6)}.ds-nav a[aria-current=location]::after{content:'';position:absolute;width:5px;height:5px;background:var(--violet,#6041a6);border-radius:50%;bottom:3px;left:calc(50% - 2px)}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--violet,#6041a6);outline-offset:5px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav a{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Service disclosure",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Native disclosure with a stacked descriptive line and CSS plus/minus.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-service\"><summary><span class=\"ds-service-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" r=\"2.3\"/><path d=\"m5 10 7 3 7-3M12 13v4m0 0-4 5m4-5 4 5\"/></svg></span><h3>Intervención infantil<span>Crecer, jugar y descubrir</span></h3><span class=\"ds-toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"ds-body\">A través del juego trabajamos el desarrollo motor, sensorial, cognitivo y social de niños y niñas que encuentran dificultades en su crecimiento.</div></details>",
      "css": ".ds-service{border-block:1px solid var(--rule,#dfd9e7);font-family:var(--font,'Figtree','Segoe UI',sans-serif);color:var(--ink-2,#635e6c)}.ds-service summary{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding-block:27px;cursor:pointer;list-style:none}.ds-service summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-service h3{flex:1;min-width:0;margin:0;font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.13;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--violet-deep,#39235e)}.ds-service h3 span{display:block;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.5;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;color:var(--ink-2,#635e6c);margin-top:5px}.ds-service summary:hover h3{color:var(--violet,#6041a6)}.ds-service summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--violet,#6041a6);outline-offset:5px}.ds-service-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:62px;height:62px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:18px;background:var(--peach,#f9dfcc);color:var(--violet-deep,#39235e)}.ds-service-icon svg{width:29px;height:29px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-toggle{position:relative;width:24px;height:24px;flex-shrink:0}.ds-toggle::before,.ds-toggle::after{content:'';position:absolute;width:14px;height:1.5px;background:var(--violet,#6041a6);top:11px;left:5px;transition:transform 250ms var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-toggle::after{transform:rotate(90deg)}.ds-service[open] .ds-toggle::after{transform:rotate(0)}.ds-body{padding:0 0 28px 80px;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.65}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-body{padding-left:0}.ds-service h3{font-size:1.2rem}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-toggle::before,.ds-toggle::after{transition:none}}"
