      "html": "<figure class=\"ds-record\"><svg class=\"ds-quotation\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 40\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 36V22C3 10 8 4 20 2v8c-6 2-8 5-8 10h9v16H3Zm25 0V22C28 10 33 4 45 2v8c-6 2-8 5-8 10h9v16H28Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg><blockquote>Contenido de la entrada existente.</blockquote><figcaption><span class=\"ds-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">N</span><span><strong>Nombre de la entrada</strong><span class=\"ds-date\">Fecha de la entrada</span></span></figcaption></figure>",
